  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved psychosocial services in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Psychologists from Roehampton University (School of Human and Life Sciences) were brought in to develop a training programme to improve the skills of the Islamic Relief Psychosocial Centre staff in Gaza.  After carrying out the training in Gaza, they provided follow-up from the UK through a range of communication tools such as video conferencing and Skype.</narrative>
  </description>
